[5] Prime-certificate tournament
  pairwise observable: more least-blocker wins on the degree-4 scout
  switch/gauge: primitive part by Gauss lemma; degree-drop primes ignored
  tie Hamiltonian path: 2 -> 3 -> 5 -> ... -> 31
  least_blocker_counts={2: 784, 3: 508, 5: 744, 7: 472, 11: 264, 13: 120, 17: 76, 19: 58, 23: 20, 29: 12, 31: 0}
  unresolved_irreducibles=38
